note as BIZ_diagram_26b_insurance_operations
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Covers real-time eligibility, prior authorization, claim submission, immutable
  adjudication versions and patient-facing explanations of benefits. Settlement,
  reconciliation, disputes and reversals are separated into module 26C.
end note




