note as APPEND_diagram_26b_insurance_operations
  ADJUDICATION RULE
  Eligibility responses, authorization determinations and claim adjudications are
  immutable versions. New decisions supersede but never mutate prior evidence.
  Patient-facing explanations must exclude confidential settlement details.
end note

' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' SOURCE CONSOLIDATED: diagram_26c_insurance_reconciliation_appeals.puml
' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
note as BIZ_diagram_26c_insurance_reconciliation_appeals
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Separates post-adjudication money reconciliation and legal/administrative dispute
  workflows from claim intake. Coordination and decision evidence remain versioned
  or immutable; reversals create new records and never rewrite adjudication history.
end note







