note as INTEGRITY_diagram_26c_insurance_reconciliation_appeals
  Reconciliation items reference the exact adjudication version being settled.
  Appeal decisions and reversals are append-only and idempotent; replacement claims
  are separate claims linked from the reversal instead of mutations of the original.
end note


